		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Workflow map\nThe whole weekend on one page. Every blue link opens the note behind it.\n\nStart: [[Home]] · Rules: [[Rules]] · Tasks: [board on GitHub](https://github.com/users/C-Nietzschmann/projects/3)",
			"x": -30,
			"y": -330,
			"width": 620,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "p1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Before kickoff\nFri 13 Nov\n\n[[Setup]] · [[Rules]] · [[Team]]\nRegister by Sat 05:59",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Kickoff call\nSat 08:00\n\nPick a track and one idea\n→ [[Idea]]",
			"x": 410,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Scope lock\nSat 10:00\n\n[[Idea]] complete, the dataset loads, everyone has a P0 task",
			"x": 820,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Skeleton\nSat 14:00\n\nA baseline runs end to end. First number in [[Evaluation]]",
			"x": 1230,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## MVP gate\nSat 21:00\n\nThe demo path works, or we cut features until it does",
			"x": 1640,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Feature freeze\nSun 14:00\n\nFrom here only [[Evaluation]], [[Write-up]], [[Demo Script]] and bug fixes",
			"x": 2050,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Submit\nSun 21:00\n\n[[Submission Checklist]], together on the call",
			"x": 2460,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "l1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 1 · Pick a task\nOn the [GitHub board](https://github.com/users/C-Nietzschmann/projects/3): assign yourself, drag the card to In Progress\n\n[[Task Protocol]]",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 460,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "l2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 2 · Build it\nIn your own notebook, in Colab\n\n[[Colab Workflow]]",
			"x": 920,
			"y": 460,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "l3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 3 · Measure it\nA number next to the baseline, logged in [[Evaluation]]\n\n[[Evaluation Protocol]]",
			"x": 1280,
			"y": 460,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "l4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 4 · Explain it\nWrite \"How it works\" in your own words. If you can't, it isn't done\n\n[[AI Agent Protocol]]",
			"x": 1280,
			"y": 780,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "l5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 5 · Push it\n`git sync \"what changed, closes #12\"`\nor tell Claude: **push**\n\n[[Sync]]",
			"x": 920,
			"y": 780,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "l6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 6 · Done\nThe card moves to Done by itself. Add your \"How it works\" comment, pick the next",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 780,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Stuck for 20 minutes?\nUnmute and say it. Set the task to `blocked`\n\n[[Calls]]",
			"x": 1660,
			"y": 460,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Check-ins, 10 minutes\nSat 08 · 10 · 14 · 18 · 21\nSun 09 · 14 · 18 · 20\nClaude drafts it: say **check-in**\n\n[[Timeline]] · [[Sync notes]]",
			"x": 1660,
			"y": 780,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### You or Claude\n`git sync`\nor say **push** to Claude",
			"x": 250,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Check on your computer\nNo secrets, no merge leftovers, no huge files, notebooks valid\n\nStops here if something is wrong",
			"x": 580,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "a3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Share\nSave your changes → get your teammates' → upload yours",
			"x": 910,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "a4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### GitHub checks again\nThe same check, plus the tests\n\nCode pushes only",
			"x": 1240,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "a5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ✓ main is green\nCarry on",
			"x": 1620,
			"y": 1200,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ✗ MAIN BROKEN\nNobody pushes code. Fix it, or revert within 15 minutes\n\n[[Git Workflow]]",
			"x": 1620,
			"y": 1360,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 210,
			"color": "1"
		}
	],
